---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  heading="Terms of Use"
  description={`Website terms governing use of the ${site.name} demonstration roofing website.`}
>
  <h2>Using this website</h2>
  <p>These Terms of Use apply to your use of this website. By using the site, you agree to use it lawfully and not interfere with its security, availability, forms, or other visitors.</p>

  <h2>Website information</h2>
  <p>Website content is provided for general informational and inquiry purposes. Roofing conditions vary by property, materials, weather, building requirements, and the scope found during an inspection. Website information does not replace an on-site assessment or a written project agreement.</p>

  <h2>Estimates, inspections, and services</h2>
  <p>Submitting a website form does not create a contractor-client relationship, guarantee availability, reserve an appointment, or form a binding service contract. Any real roofing work should be governed by the production business's written estimate, scope, pricing, scheduling, warranty, cancellation, and payment terms.</p>

  <h2>Insurance and claim information</h2>
  <p>Any assistance with photographs, scopes, or storm-damage documentation is informational. Coverage, deductibles, claim decisions, and payments are determined by the applicable insurer and policy. The website should not be interpreted as promising a particular insurance outcome.</p>

  <h2>Accuracy of business claims</h2>
  <p>A production website owner is responsible for verifying all licenses, insurance statements, warranties, service areas, ratings, reviews, certifications, pricing statements, response times, and other business claims before publication.</p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>Unless otherwise stated, the website design, written content, graphics, and other original materials are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. Third-party names, marks, icons, fonts, and other materials remain the property of their respective owners and are subject to their own licenses.</p>

  <h2>Third-party services and links</h2>
  <p>The production site may connect to third-party hosting, communications, CRM, scheduling, payment, analytics, map, social, or automation services. Those services may have separate terms and privacy practices. The website owner is responsible for configuring and disclosing them appropriately.</p>

  <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
  <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, the website is provided on an “as available” basis without a guarantee that every page, feature, or external service will always be uninterrupted or error-free. Mandatory consumer rights are not limited by these terms.</p>

  <h2>Limitation and governing terms</h2>
  <p>Any production business should replace this section with limitations of liability, dispute terms, and governing-law provisions appropriate to its actual jurisdiction and customer agreements. Nothing in this demonstration is intended to waive rights that cannot lawfully be waived.</p>

  <h2>Contact and changes</h2>
  <p>Questions about the production website terms should be directed to the real business contact shown on the site. These terms may be updated when website features, services, or legal requirements change.</p>

  <p class="legal-note"><strong>Template notice:</strong> Rooflume is a fictional demonstration brand. A buyer should have these terms reviewed and adapted for the actual contractor, location, and sales process before launch.</p>
</LegalLayout>
